    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a proposal for a new multi-family residential development in a mid-sized metro area. I need to prep for some upcoming town hall meetings. Can you give me a rundown of the main criticisms and concerns people usually raise against high-density zoning and increased density in established neighborhoods? I need to know what I'm actually up against.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
